abstract: >
  Fully deterministic primality testing, π(n), factoring, and arithmetic
  for Python (OpenMP wheel, BLS below 256 bits, FastECPP at 256+ bits).
  No stochastic Miller–Rabin. AKS is not a product-path fallback.
keywords:
  - primality
  - deterministic
  - ECPP
  - FastECPP
  - OpenMP
  - number theory
